<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Satara | Secure Two-Wheeler Shifting Maharashtra
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad guarantee zero scratches during bike transportation in Satara?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a 4‑layer cushioning system that starts with 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, followed by high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, and a final stretch‑film seal. Each bike is secured on hydraulic‑ramp trailers with ratchet lashings, and real‑time GPS monitoring ensures no rough handling, delivering a scratch‑free parcel.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for a bike parcel from Satara to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 850 km journey from Satara to Mumbai usually takes 14‑16 hours by road, depending on traffic and weather conditions. Our dedicated multi‑axle carriers travel on National Highway corridors with scheduled rest stops, ensuring timely delivery while maintaining the safety standards promised in our bike transportation service.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I ship my scooter via bus or train instead of road transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While bus and train options like IRCTC bike parcel or bus bike parcel exist, they lack the specialized hydraulic ramp trailers, 4‑layer protection, and live tracking we provide. For high‑value or fragile two‑wheelers, road transport with Shree Ashirwad guarantees superior safety, insurance coverage, and door‑to‑door service.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for bike transportation in Satara?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Customers must provide a valid government‑issued ID, bike registration certificate, and a signed consignment note. For corporate or government shipments, GST‑compliant invoices and e‑Way bills are also required. Our team assists in preparing all paperwork to ensure smooth customs‑free interstate movement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the insurance claim process work if my bike gets damaged in transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our full‑value transit insurance is IRDAI‑approved. In the unlikely event of damage, we file a claim within 24 hours, submit photographic evidence, and coordinate with the insurer to settle the declared value directly with the customer. The process is transparent, and you receive compensation without additional paperwork.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you accept GST invoices for corporate reimbursement claims?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every bike transportation invoice includes a GST‑compliant breakdown, along with our registered GSTIN. We also provide e‑Way bill numbers and detailed cost matrices, making it easy for corporate clients, PSUs, or government departments to claim reimbursements without any hassle.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a weight limit for two‑wheeler transport on your hydraulic ramp trailers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our hydraulic ramp trailers are designed to handle two‑wheelers up to 250 kg, covering most motorcycles, scooters, and small ATVs. For heavier custom bikes, we offer dedicated single‑vehicle carriers with reinforced chassis and additional securing mechanisms, ensuring safe transit regardless of weight.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
